# Fill these from `azd env get-values` (or the deployment outputs) and the key from the README.
@gateway = https://apim-orders-xxxxxxxx.azure-api.net/sales
@key = <primary key of the contoso-shop subscription>

### 1. No key: 401 from the gateway, the function never sees the call
GET {{gateway}}/orders

### 2. Key in the header: 200
GET {{gateway}}/orders
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{key}}

### 3. Place an order: 201 with a Location header
# @name create
POST {{gateway}}/orders
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "C-1001",
  "lines": [
    { "sku": "BOOK-0042", "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 24.90 },
    { "sku": "PEN-0007", "quantity": 10, "unitPrice": 1.50 }
  ]
}

### 4. Read it back
GET {{gateway}}/orders/{{create.response.body.$.orderId}}
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{key}}

### 5. Validation failure: 400 from the function, passed through by the gateway
POST {{gateway}}/orders
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: {{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "customerId": "C-1001", "lines": [] }

### 6. Key in the query string: also 200, but now the key sits in every access log on the way
GET {{gateway}}/orders?subscription-key={{key}}

### 7. Wrong key: 401
GET {{gateway}}/orders
Ocp-Apim-Subscription-Key: 00000000000000000000000000000000
